      "cooked": "<p>Help!  :-[</p>\n<p>We love the theme of the game and most of it’s mechanics. However we have a major problem : Damage calculation.  We always seem to take a lot of time wondering how much damage we do or suffer between the interactive powers. Subzero is a headache for us! ^^<br>\nAre we doing something wrong?  :-[</p>",
