      "created_at": "2012-05-22T17:49:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I generally just apply the base damage and then look around the table for any modifiers, counting plus or minus as appropriate until I’ve made a complete circle of the table. Absolute Zero, as mentioned, can complicate things, but that’s why I like him. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>",
